---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import { business } from '../site';
---
<Site><section class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT STORE. CLEARER NEXT STEP.</p><h1>Make your product page<br/><em>easier to buy from.</em></h1><p class="lede">A focused review of what shoppers see, understand and do next. Get evidence you can act on, with a clear scope from the start.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss your page ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/sample/">Explore a sample report →</a></div><p class="micro">Shopify first · One page at a time · Human-reviewed findings</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="report-top"><span class="dot"></span> THE PRODUCT-PAGE REVIEW <span>01</span></div><div class="mock-product"><div class="product-shape"><div class="cup"></div><span>YOUR PRODUCT</span></div><div><small>LESS GUESSWORK</small><h3>A clearer<br/>buying decision.</h3><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton short"></div><div class="mock-button">Choose your option</div></div></div><div class="note"><span>↗</span><div><b>Turn observations into next steps.</b><p>Evidence → Priority → Recommendation</p></div></div><div class="report-bottom">ILLUSTRATIVE REVIEW / NOT A CLIENT RESULT</div></div></section>
<div class="principles"><span>Understand the offer</span><span>Choose with confidence</span><span>Find the next step</span></div>
<section class="wrap section" id="service"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / A SMALL, USEFUL START</p><h2>One page. A focused review.</h2><p>Start with a product page and one visitor action. We look for friction in the information and the observable journey.</p></div><div class="cards"><article><span class="number">01</span><h3>Product clarity</h3><p>Can a shopper understand the product, quantities, options and the information they need to decide?</p></article><article><span class="number">02</span><h3>The next action</h3><p>Are important controls understandable? We distinguish reproducible issues from recommendations and untested assumptions.</p></article><article><span class="number">03</span><h3>A practical handoff</h3><p>Get dated evidence, up to three priorities and one annotated improvement concept or copy comparison.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="offer wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE SINGLE-PAGE REVIEW</p><h2>A defined first step.<br/>A manageable commitment.</h2><ul class="checks"><li>One product page, desktop and mobile viewports</li><li>Evidence-led English report and test limitations</li><li>Up to three priorities, where supported by evidence</li><li>One improvement concept and one factual revision</li></ul></div><div class="price"><span>PROPOSED INTRODUCTORY FEE</span><strong>{business.price}</strong><p>Delivery within 2 business days after scope agreement and complete inputs.</p><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Check whether it's a fit ↗</a><small>Written quote and payment terms agreed before work. Implementation and third-party costs excluded.</small></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>From a page to a plan.</h2></div><div class="steps"><article><b>01 / Tell us the goal</b><p>Share the URL, market and action you want visitors to take. No administrator password needed.</p></article><article><b>02 / Agree the scope</b><p>Confirm checks, fee and delivery. If access prevents testing, agree an alternative before proceeding.</p></article><article><b>03 / Review the evidence</b><p>Receive observations and recommendations. Small implementation work can be quoted separately.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="wrap safety"><div><p class="eyebrow">CAREFUL CHANGES, CLEAR BOUNDARIES</p><h2>Your live store deserves care.</h2></div><p>Implementation starts with agreed permissions, backup coverage and a preview or unpublished theme. Publishing needs your approval. Recovery depends on your platform and apps; we don't promise zero data loss or guaranteed conversion gains.</p></section>
<section class="wrap section faq"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE START</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2><details><summary>Is this an automated AI audit?</summary><p>This is a human-reviewed service supported by tools. Findings are checked and limitations disclosed; an automated score alone is not the deliverable.</p></details><details><summary>Do you need access to my store admin?</summary><p>Not for the public product-page review. Implementation access is scoped separately. Never send passwords, payment data or customer exports with your initial request.</p></details><details><summary>Can you guarantee more sales?</summary><p>No. Acceptance is based on the agreed report and evidence, not a sales target. Recommendations can be tested later with suitable traffic and measurement.</p></details><details><summary>Is the sample a real client case?</summary><p>No. It is a clearly labelled self-created demonstration. We do not present sample work as paid client results.</p></details></section>
<section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow">START WITH ONE PAGE</p><h2>What would you like<br/>your shoppers to understand?</h2><a class="button" href="/contact/">Prepare your review brief ↗</a></section></Site>